      "id": "claim_fd092d5051ab43a8b24b8fad73618eb1",
      "statement": "Assignment writes are plain tag edits: the organizer itself files through fileMany/unfileMany in panel/organizerData.ts (one transaction; items already carrying the tag and non-editable items such as other users' group annotations are skipped), while external tools use PATCH /api/users/0/items/<annotationKey> with the full tags array (204) or POST /api/users/0/items batches of up to 50 (413 above), sending the current version (stale returns 412), a Zotero-Server-ID header (otherwise 428), and a Zotero-API-Key from POST /api/local/authorize (one-use keys are consumed when checked; unregistered keys 401; read-only library 403; browser User-Agent/Origin requests need Zotero-Allowed-Request: 1).",
