      "id": "claim_a8df6c14f64a458ea39b0336cc256a04",
      "statement": "The browse-window cycle: a real request opens the dialog via openPersistent; after an accepted insert the wrapper captures the live geometry, the command's end closes the dialog and openBrowse opens a fresh citationDialog.xhtml with a synthetic CitationEditInterface (isAddingAnnotations = true, no document); inserting from the browse window cannot use the native accept (the dialog reads its io once in onLoad and accept() tears the views down), so insertFromBrowse re-runs execCommand(agent, \"addAnnotation\", docId, templateVersion) with the remembered command and the patched displayDialog copies pendingInsert into the command's io without opening a window; one real request is needed first because agent and docId are only known from a command Zotero ran.",
